id: MOD6-4
package: fandhe-workshop-pack
test: start_skip
target: crates/core/src/begin.rs
find:         .filter(|n| n.unit == node.unit && n.scope == node.scope && n.step.use_module.is_none())
replace: .filter(|n| n.unit == node.unit && n.step.use_module.is_none())
expect-fail: mod6_start_after_round1_skips_only_round2_instance_steps
note: 同じ実体の条件を外し、前の周回の未着手の Step も省略にする
